### 20. `datetime.utcnow()` is Deprecated in Python 3.12+
**File:** [`models.py`](file:///d:/SPAR-NSR/AI%20Team/demo_280826/Vendor_Invoice_Management_POC/vim_database/models.py) (multiple lines), [`dashboard/service.py:34`](file:///d:/SPAR-NSR/AI%20Team/demo_280826/Vendor_Invoice_Management_POC/vim/dashboard/service.py#L34)

```python
default=datetime.utcnow   # deprecated
now = datetime.utcnow()   # deprecated
```

`datetime.utcnow()` is deprecated in Python 3.12 and will be removed in a future version. Use `datetime.now(timezone.utc)` instead.

